### 1. OVERVIEW
GETLB is a free, open-source timeline synchronization and baking tool designed for Cascadeur and Blender. 

The Software consists of the following open-source components:
a) Blender-side component
b) Cascadeur-side Python component

Both components are provided in source code format.

